			"end": 1192
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " carries no break point, so the width sheds into the arguments",
			"start": 1194,
			"end": 1258
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " NOT the clause: the call has no arguments, so the lookup keeps its break point",
